strated, worn, applied, or shown in use? Can a viewer understand what the product IS and what it DOES within the first few seconds of seeing it? Is the product the star, or is it hidden in the background?\n\n3. Sales Approach — Is there a clear selling angle: pain point, desire, social proof, urgency, comparison? Does the creator make the viewer want this product? Is the selling natural or does it feel forced and scripted? Is there a reason to buy NOW vs later?\n\n4. Purchase Pathway — Is there a clear way for viewers to buy? Did the creator direct them to the yellow basket, shop link, or product page? Is the call to action specific (not just \"link in bio\" but \"tap the yellow basket\")? Would a viewer know exactly what to do next?\n\n5. Technical Execution — Audio clarity, lighting, camera work, editing quality. Is the video watchable? Does the caption enhance the sales message or is it generic? Is the video the right length for the content?\n\n---\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. No text before or after.\n\n{\n  \"verification_status\": \"Approved, Rejected, or Pending\",\n  \"ai_confidence_score\": \"0-100\",\n  \"rejection_reason\": \"null OR one of: Wrong content type, Low quality video, Reposted content, Suspicious content, Other\",\n  \"concept_name\": \"short descriptive name for this review, max 5 words\",\n  \"content_summary\": \"2-3 sentence description of what the video shows\",\n  \"product_identified\": \"name of the product shown, or null if not identifiable\",\n  \"overall_score\": \"0-100 — average of score_1 through score_5\",\n  \"overall_comment\": \"2-3 sentence summary of strengths and the ONE thing to focus on next\",\n  \"focus_for_next_video\": \"ONE specific, actionable improvement (never a list)\",\n  \"metrics_analysis\": \"1-2 sentences interpreting the engagement metrics\",\n  \"score_1\": \"0-100\",\n  \"score_1_comment\": \"Hook & Attention — what their hook did well and what they could try next time. Reference the specific opening.\",\n